00:58:50.560 --> 00:59:00.560
Please kill me in the halloum after mine, because my bones are full of fear.

00:59:03.560 --> 00:59:09.560
Ten years ago, nobody would have been able to explain this. Nobody would have been able to explain this.

00:59:11.560 --> 00:59:15.560
Today I can explain it, because I read a couple of years ago,

00:59:15.560 --> 00:59:23.560
I went to the neuro-cancer section in the neuro-cancer. I went to the science section.

00:59:23.560 --> 00:59:31.560
It's only very interesting that the immunological system in the human body is connected with the

00:59:31.560 --> 00:59:44.800
the marrows of the bones. Marrows of the bones. Somehow they are connected to the immune system.

00:59:44.800 --> 00:59:52.240
What King David says, Nip'anoo asaman. From the fear that I have, my bones, means the

00:59:52.240 --> 01:00:00.140
inside my bones are afraid, means I can no longer function. Asaman means the inner and

01:00:00.140 --> 01:00:04.140
the marrows of my bones, I pray.

01:00:04.140 --> 01:00:08.140
This is called the immeasurable system.

01:00:08.140 --> 01:00:11.140
Guard me from all sicknesses.

01:00:11.140 --> 01:00:15.140
Walk away all kind of germs, bacteria, viruses, etc.

01:00:15.140 --> 01:00:19.140
Nim Haluk Asamon

01:00:19.140 --> 01:00:27.140
And why is it that I have so much fear within me?

01:00:27.140 --> 01:00:37.140
The Naqshib, we have had on the earth, my soul is even more afraid than the marrows of my bones.

01:00:37.140 --> 01:00:48.140
It's psychosomatic. I have the psychosomatic sickness. I understand the gravity of the Avon I made,

01:00:48.140 --> 01:00:56.140
And it's affecting the marrows of my bones. Extraordinary.

01:00:56.140 --> 01:01:04.140
And I said, the nafsheen in halal et al, more than the marrows of my bones, is the soul.

01:01:04.140 --> 01:01:11.140
The atah of nafs. And I had to learn that when I was meeting the priest.

01:01:11.140 --> 01:01:16.140
No matter who it is for you, God in a sense has relations with David.

01:01:16.140 --> 01:01:21.140
David was afraid of God's word, not seeing him again.

01:01:21.140 --> 01:01:26.140
