01:01:51.640 --> 01:01:54.640
And this is what King David was afraid.

01:01:54.640 --> 01:02:02.140
King David was afraid that he was removed from the face of God.

01:02:02.140 --> 01:02:15.140
Benata Adonai, Adonai, Shuvah Adonai, return to me God.

01:02:15.140 --> 01:02:29.140
And in this way, when my soul is going to feel your presence, my soul is going to be strong.

01:02:29.140 --> 01:02:38.140
Because in feeling this way, strengthen my soul. Because my soul is weak, and my body is weak because of my soul.

01:02:38.140 --> 01:02:40.140
Because you are not present.

01:02:40.140 --> 01:02:42.140
Shura Adonai.

01:02:42.140 --> 01:02:44.140
And by you returning God,

01:02:44.140 --> 01:02:46.140
