01:02:56.140 --> 01:02:58.140
All of this is spiritual Hoshi'in.

01:02:58.140 --> 01:03:01.140
And that's why I think this is the sin that is talking.

01:03:01.140 --> 01:03:03.140
Hoshi'in from the sin.

01:03:03.140 --> 01:03:07.140
Saving from the sin.

01:03:07.140 --> 01:03:12.140
