01:03:12.140 --> 01:03:17.140
And do it as an act of mercy.

01:03:17.140 --> 01:03:20.140
It's a notion of teshuvah.

01:03:20.140 --> 01:03:23.140
Teshuvah Adonai.

01:03:23.140 --> 01:03:30.140
So even this is more than better for a psychological, mental sickness than a physical sickness.

01:03:30.140 --> 01:03:33.140
But we believe that there are two types of sicknesses.

01:03:33.140 --> 01:03:41.700
The worst type of sickness in our... I mean, let me speak in singular.

01:03:41.700 --> 01:03:44.180
