01:04:24.020 --> 01:04:28.020
What David is asking here is not about the Quran.

01:04:28.020 --> 01:04:37.020
Hoshi'ani, Hoshi'ani, saved me. He wants to know that God is at the end of the tunnel, so to speak.

01:04:37.020 --> 01:04:42.020
That he's suffering, but that's how he knows that God says, I don't want you no more.

01:04:42.020 --> 01:04:50.020
That is the point of King David, and that's why, even when we are sick, we want to, sometimes we want to watch the hourglass, watch the bedroom.

01:04:50.020 --> 01:04:54.820
But we want to know that there is life at the end of the tunnel. That is the point.

01:04:54.820 --> 01:04:57.820
Hoshi'in liman hazehka.

01:04:57.820 --> 01:05:00.820
